ORACLE: static placement vs abstract interpreter (see test/README.md).
RUN: %python %sea_src_root/utils/fuzz-place.py --sea-opt sea-opt --sea-run sea-run --sea-vc sea-vc --seed 1 -n 40 --runs 3 | FileCheck %s
CHECK: programs: 40 sat: {{[0-9]+}} unsat: {{[0-9]+}} failures: 0
Wider pointers (SeaHorn's layout at 32 bits, the compact one at 16) with
power-of-two slots (sea-place-static slots=aligned).
RUN: %python %sea_src_root/utils/fuzz-place.py --sea-opt sea-opt --sea-run sea-run --sea-vc sea-vc --seed 2 -n 30 --runs 3 --width 32 --slots aligned | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SLOTS
RUN: %python %sea_src_root/utils/fuzz-place.py --sea-opt sea-opt --sea-run sea-run --sea-vc sea-vc --seed 3 -n 20 --runs 3 --width 16 --slots aligned | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SLOTS16
SLOTS: programs: 30 sat: {{[0-9]+}} unsat: {{[0-9]+}} failures: 0
SLOTS16: programs: 20 sat: {{[0-9]+}} unsat: {{[0-9]+}} failures: 0

